# EuroSAT Satellite Image Classification via Advanced CLIP Paradigms

This repository evaluates and compares various vision-language paradigms, fine-tuning mechanisms, and custom architectures on the **EuroSAT RGB** dataset for land use and land cover classification. 

We benchmark zero-shot performance, parameter-efficient adaptations, transfer learning adapters, and full cross-modality domain alignment.

## 📋 Table of Contents
- [Overview](#-overview)
